# REIMPORT ONE RECIPE — and investigate a failed reimport.
# See README.md for environments and labels.
#
# Reimport rebuilds the WHOLE recipe from its URL or photos with AI: name,
# ingredients, steps, language and images can all change. It also saves an
# import report. Send it once per recipe; do not loop or "Send All".
#
# A. Reimport:      1 → 2 → 3 → 4
# B. Investigate:   set @importId from the recipe's "Review issue" sheet → 3 → 5

@recipeId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@importId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
@taskId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. READ ONLY — Recipe before the reimport (save this response)
# Check: canReimport is true and no import is already running.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### 2. CHANGES DATA + AI — Report a problem and start the reimport (send ONCE)
# reasons: what is wrong. note: tells the AI what to fix; it must say something useful.
# Success: reimportStarted true, reimportLaunchFailed false, importId set.
# An already active report can return its existing importId.
# 400 missing member header · 409 source not eligible or another report is active.
# On a timeout, check request 1 before sending this again.
# @name reimport
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}/import-report
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

{
  "reasons": ["steps"],
  "note": "The saved instructions are missing their full step text. Recover every complete instruction from the original URL or photos. Do not invent steps."
}

### 3. READ ONLY — Reimport workflow and task errors
# Uses the importId from request 2. For investigation, replace it with {{importId}}.
# Returns 404 unless familyMemberId is the member who added the recipe.
# Paused or Failed: copy the failed task's taskId into @taskId and send 5.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipe-imports/{{reimport.response.body.$.importId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### 4. READ ONLY — Recipe after the reimport (compare with request 1)
# Check the steps, and look for unwanted changes to name, ingredients or language.
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/recipes/{{recipeId}}
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}
X-Family-Member-Id: {{familyMemberId}}

### 5. READ ONLY — Why a task failed (error and stack trace)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/workflows/tasks/{{taskId}}/diagnostics
Accept: application/json
X-Hearth-Secret: {{hearthSecret}}

# Status numbers in raw responses:
#   workflow: 0 Pending, 1 Processing, 2 Completed, 3 Failed, 4 Paused
#   task:     0 Waiting, 1 Pending, 2 Processing, 3 Completed, 4 Failed
